# 🛒 Smart E-Commerce Management System

A full-stack Django-based E-Commerce Web Application with secure authentication, cart management, order processing, feedback analysis, and admin dashboard management.

---

 🚀 Project Overview

This system provides a complete online shopping experience with:

- Secure User Registration & Login
- Product Category Browsing
- Shopping Cart Management
- Order Placement & Tracking
- Product Reviews & Ratings
- Admin Dashboard Analytics
- Product & Category Management
- Order Status Control
- User Account Management

---

 🛠️ Tech Stack

Backend
- Django
- Python

Database
- SQLite

Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- Bootstrap
- JavaScript

Security
- Password Hashing
- Session Authentication
- Access Control

---

 ✨ Key Features

 👤 User Module
- User Registration & Login
- Account Profile Management
- Password Update
- Session-based Authentication

 🛍️ Shopping Module
- Browse Products by Category
- Product Detail View
- Add to Cart
- Update Cart Quantity
- Remove Products
- Checkout System

 📦 Order Management
- Place Orders
- View Order History
- Order Tracking
- Cancel Orders
- Automatic Product Restocking

 ⭐ Feedback System
- Product Ratings (1–5)
- Review Submission
- Review Update
- Product Feedback Analysis

 🛠️ Admin Panel
- Dashboard Analytics
- User Management
- Product CRUD Operations
- Category Management
- Order Status Updates
- Feedback Monitoring
- Revenue Tracking

---

